cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or method, please cite it as below."
title: "Viking Lander 2 SEISF cassette Path-D decoder"
authors:
  - family-names: Yamamoto
    given-names: Yukio
    affiliation: "Institute of Space and Astronautical Science (ISAS/JAXA)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7172-1911"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/isas-yamamoto/viking-vl2-seisf-decode"
abstract: >-
  Software and materials for unscrambling Viking Lander 2 SEISF (DLT)
  cassette science buffers into VUS-compatible 2048-bit frames using
  pair-36 packing and PD7400072 Q=matv page reordering, validated
  bit-exactly against matching VUS frames.
keywords:
  - Viking
  - Mars
  - seismology
  - data recovery
  - bitstream
  - digital preservation
  - reverse engineering
